            <ArticleTitle>[New aspects in the treatment of pain in patients with carcinomas].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>253-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The object of this paper is to give a review of a) physiologic and psychologic effects of cancer pain; b) the etiology and possible mechanisms of cancer pain; c) the basic principles of its management. This paper also describes some different modes of pharmacological treatments of cancer pain with special reference to the oral and epidural use of morphine.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
